.TH DOODLE 1
.SH NAME
doodle \- freehand drawing
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/doodle
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Doodle
is a freehand drawing.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 1 paints freehand strokes; button 2 or c cycles colour.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB drag
Draw
.TP
.B RMB
Cycle color
.TP
.B c
Cycle color
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/doodle.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
